      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I hear you—when the end result feels identical, the choice can seem hollow. But that logic assumes the value is only in the outcome, not in the experience itself. The moments of connection, curiosity, or even small relief along the way are real, even if they don't change the universe. You don't have to find a grand meaning to justify staying; sometimes just being here to see what happens next is enough.",
